# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify response headers (ignored by hosts that do not support the file).
# Cross-origin isolation enables multi-threaded WASM detection; where these headers cannot be sent
# (GitHub Pages) the app's service worker adds them instead.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
